{"r0": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreTheme/197493555582", "t0": [{"locale": "nl", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r3.heading:21kytgsmtyi21", "value": "Er is een fles gebroken aangekomen, wat nu?", "translatableContentDigest": "eb3ab80182d5a5fdc956b24981ebea9fa1cbe9a208081ee20ec26e73fa57e010"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.collection.huiles.json.faq.wrap__acc__r3__t.text:4y15lvp5troo", "value": "<p>Schrijf ons binnen 48 uur met een foto via onze <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contactpagina</a>. Wij sturen u een nieuwe fles of betalen u terug.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "4a34a8a3b64e6f5bfacd88d365d0812a2ec36c80433e493d49a560bec16cbeb9"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__reassure.text:259e9oakn9767", "value": "<p>Levering in België · Veilig betalen · Retour binnen 14 dagen (ongeopende fles)</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "ae66d6338fcee6aa18f5816696f7067d2db732e0ca7f8353038fdc55691f25f4"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1.heading:3qeyc3s3mwtps", "value": "Levering", "translatableContentDigest": "a8b3d250ac9e1bcd509ffd32eadc4ef0c09164fdd91d99b236ea0bb4bdaa6510"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r1__t.text:3dwdgexkzggoh", "value": "<p>Uw bestelling vertrekt vanuit Parijs met Chronopost en wordt in België geleverd in 2 tot 3 werkdagen. De verzendkosten ziet u in het winkelmandje, vóór de betaling.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "0450c065e1b45eb858889c8b948bd469ab8ed255a456f52506b21ecbe78d6cff"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r2.heading:2nnvr8xikb7ir", "value": "Bewaring", "translatableContentDigest": "e43f60bbc4e69bac962d92f4e903eb284d459dd45574a3cdc7d767b5943fb26d"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r2__t.text:x9d9avz43y36", "value": "<p>Goed afgesloten, beschermd tegen licht en warmte. Bewaar ze niet naast het fornuis.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "0a8a4d650d7678f4536efdf6fd00712e245c0017ba7d8ddcd442aa84878bb8c8"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r3.heading:33e2pz6ppt8z6", "value": "Retours", "translatableContentDigest": "7c442e059901cc54a0566925d705e35b921fa5f3434308d6f5568fb6f6543d90"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product-information.product-details__group_J87VfC__infos__r3__t.text:goggsjvwetdf", "value": "<p>U hebt 14 dagen na ontvangst om van gedachten te veranderen, als de fles niet geopend is. Een fles gebroken aangekomen? Schrijf ons binnen 48 uur met een foto: wij sturen u een nieuwe of betalen u terug.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "099913bf3a518215d29db852186756b102608e79c404d665e50d5b989de7d12c"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.product.json.product_recommendations_8RVdzU.text_w3FTGV.text:2rc4obkofn2hs", "value": "<h3>Onze andere oliën</h3>", "translatableContentDigest": "a6535a1f57c7ab6686ced6fa598782537b5e3b186864f355331dd2781021facb"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.section_UM49qN.text_tqMiyM.text:1oumnf91bsuhp", "value": "<h2>Blijf op de hoogte</h2>", "translatableContentDigest": "e1b21028a2148d618a16522a50c26a2baedeaed2d6820aeb7e501692cde35b5a"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.section_UM49qN.text_6qbwK9.text:um3hfn3k8sqw", "value": "<p>Een e-mail wanneer er een nieuwe olie binnenkomt. Meer niet.</p>", "translatableContentDigest": "3a7772ecd20230e64fc87af5280636dbd7a179481d71b716df3a8dca5e030a94"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.section_UM49qN.email_signup_zGgJDN.label:2cr327p6aa1ch", "value": "Inschrijven", "translatableContentDigest": "3c25f4fb5ef99476cb02a7fd23c019b8e06ca9f7dfea8ebf3fe0e3b952fb4364"}, {"locale": "nl", "key": "section.sections/foot